      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geneseo%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Victorian architecture graces Geneseo, and the Historical Museum offers walking tours that showcase the town’s 19th‑century heritage.",
